STAAD PLANE
* V2. Portal frame, second order (P-Δ)
* Exported by Frame2D Studio. Units kN, m. Sections are prismatic (AX, IZ): no shear deformation.
* Load case 1 = all loads (constant + variable at load factor 1).
START JOB INFORMATION
ENGINEER DATE 2026-11-24
END JOB INFORMATION
INPUT WIDTH 79
UNIT METER KN
JOINT COORDINATES
1 0 0 0;
2 0 4 0;
3 6 4 0;
4 6 0 0;
MEMBER INCIDENCES
1 1 2;
2 2 3;
3 4 3;
DEFINE MATERIAL START
ISOTROPIC MAT1
E 2.000000E8
POISSON 0.3
DENSITY 76.982202
ALPHA 1.2E-5
END DEFINE MATERIAL
MEMBER PROPERTY
1 3 PRIS AX 0.01709674 IZ 0.00041581519
2 PRIS AX 0.009483852 IZ 0.00033298514
CONSTANTS
MATERIAL MAT1 MEMB 1 TO 3
SUPPORTS
1 FIXED
4 FIXED
LOAD 1 LOADTYPE None TITLE ALL LOADS
JOINT LOAD
2 FY -2000
3 FY -2000
2 FX 50
* Second-order check. STAAD's P-Delta option is an approximate geometric method:
* compare it with the Frame2D second-order result at load factor 1.
PDELTA 30 ANALYSIS SMALLDELTA PRINT ALL
PRINT JOINT DISPLACEMENTS ALL
PRINT SUPPORT REACTION ALL
PRINT MEMBER FORCES ALL
FINISH
